    "title": "Liberty adds commitment from 2026 RB Cameron Wood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jon Manson ,\n1 days ago On National Signing Day, Liberty picked up a commitment from 2026 running back Cameron Wood. Wood is a 5’8″, 195 pound running back from Carrollton High School and Carrollton, Georgia. As a senior this past season, Wood had 157 carries for 1,362 yards (8.7 ypc) and 31 touchdowns... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
